labwc on QNX, from QNX's port (github.com/qnx-ports/labwc, tag qnx-0.20.2-r0,
commit 5f4c032a): libinput becomes optional (QNX has none: the libinput
configuration and the seat's libinput device handling are compiled out when
wlroots has no libinput backend), and on the QNX Screen backend labwc creates
the qnx-redir global QNX's compositors provide.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [QNX's port, kept as QNX published it]

From 5f4c032a3cd8652d3cef652ca83bb12d79d13570 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jscaff <jscaffidi@qnx.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 19:19:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] initial draft port

